cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  GPCR Sonification — β2-Adrenergic Receptor: an open-source pipeline
  for the sonification and cross-modal validation of GPCR molecular
  dynamics
message: >-
  If you use this software or its outputs, please cite the accompanying
  manuscript and the Zenodo deposit listed below.
